{'symbol': 'DFS', 'date': '2023-01-26 12:56:00', 'title': 'BANKERS HELPING BANKERS NAMES PULSE® EXCLUSIVE DEBIT PARTNER', 'text': "HOUSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--BANKERS HELPING BANKERS, AN ONLINE PLATFORM THAT PROMOTES INNOVATION AMONG COMMUNITY BANKS, HAS NAMED DISCOVER® FINANCIAL SERVICES' PULSE® DEBIT NETWORK ITS EXCLUSIVE DEBIT PARTNER. THE AGREEMENT BUILDS UPON PULSE'S LONGSTANDING SUPPORT OF COMMUNITY BANKS AND THE INDEPENDENT BANKERS ASSOCIATION OF TEXAS (IBAT), WHICH CO-FOUNDED BANKERS HELPING BANKERS IN PARTNERSHIP WITH FEDFIS."}